      "writtenOn": "2023-05-22T07:51:44Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "You must not do this here because this is running on the connectivity thread.\n\nIf you\u0027re really worried about this, you could have a complex system of keeping a queue of remaining work to do but you won\u0027t ever be able to completely solve this because in principle you could have a different carrier ID for a slot and then you can\u0027t know whether it will change in the future.\n\nFrankly I don\u0027t think this is going to happen often enough to skew the metrics. I think using UNKNOWN_CARRIER_ID here like Hansen is doing is better, and we can just ignore this in the metrics.",
