      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think you need this because you relies on only the cache value as my comment in the KeepaliveStatsTracker. In practice, you may not receive any onSubscriptionsChanged(e.g. wifi only). You code should not fail because of it.\n\nYou may also update the test case newly added because of this.",
