      "writtenOn": "2023-05-22T07:51:44Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "See the doc for addOnSubscriptionsChangedListener :\n\n     * The onSubscriptionChanged method will also be triggered once initially\n     * when calling this function.\n\nYou are supposed to be guaranteed a call to this upon registration. If not, we can\u0027t guarantee much, so I think Hansen\u0027s reasoning is good here and if we observe that we don\u0027t get a call then we need to file a bug and get SubscriptionManager fixed.\n\nIf you\u0027re really really concerned one thing you could do is to have the tracker wait for the first call before it\u0027s ready but I think that\u0027s difficult to write and not very useful in practice. In the end, it\u0027s only an extremely rare corner case which ends up with sending a data point with UNKNOWN_CARRIER_ID which we\u0027ll ignore.",
